    "Title": "Red Lvl. Contract: Protect ~mission(Objects)",
    "TitleKey": "Foxwell_DefendDestructibleEntites_S_Title_001",
    "DisplayTitle": "Red Lvl. Contract: Protect Fuel Tanks",
    "Description": "An emergency contract just came through about a gang of violent thugs wreaking havoc on one of our VIP clients\u2019 infrastructures. If available, we need you to rush to <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> and defend the client\u2019s extremely valuable <EM4>~mission(Objects)</EM4> at all costs. \n\nFoxwell is extremely aware of this group, so believe me when I say these pilots are not to be taken lightly. I strongly recommend that you arrange a <EM> highly competent backup force</EM> to fly with you to the site.\n\nIf you manage to survive the encounter with the client\u2019s property intact, we\u2019re adding  <EM4>~mission(ScripAmount) MG Scrip</EM4> any main contractor brave enough to take this job on. \n\nStay safe, and good luck,\n\nKevin Walton\nDispatcher, Foxwell Enforcement\n'Security, Your Way'\n\nFoxwell Enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the UEE. We are always looking for new operators to join our family. If you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives.",
    "DescriptionKey": "Foxwell_DefendDestructibleEntites_S_Desc_001",
    "DisplayDescription": "An emergency contract just came through about a gang of violent thugs wreaking havoc on one of our VIP clients\u2019 infrastructures. If available, we need you to rush to <EM4>Asteroid Mining Base</EM4> and defend the client\u2019s extremely valuable <EM4>Fuel Tanks</EM4> at all costs. \n\nFoxwell is extremely aware of this group, so believe me when I say these pilots are not to be taken lightly. I strongly recommend that you arrange a <EM> highly competent backup force</EM> to fly with you to the site.\n\nIf you manage to survive the encounter with the client\u2019s property intact, we\u2019re adding  <EM4>[ScripAmount] MG Scrip</EM4> any main contractor brave enough to take this job on. \n\nStay safe, and good luck,\n\nKevin Walton\nDispatcher, Foxwell Enforcement\n'Security, Your Way'\n\nFoxwell Enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the UEE. We are always looking for new operators to join our family. If you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives.",
